  "captions": [
    {
      "start": 0.23,
      "end": 4.534,
      "zh": "很多人学 Python，*第一天就卡在装环境*。",
      "en": "Many beginners get stuck on day one: installing Python."
    },
    {
      "start": 4.634,
      "end": 8.986,
      "zh": "系统自带的、官网下的，*三个 Python 打架*。",
      "en": "The system one and the installer one end up fighting."
    },
    {
      "start": 9.086,
      "end": 13.654,
      "zh": "其实只要两条命令：*uv init*，再 *uv add*。",
      "en": "Two commands are enough: uv init, then uv add."
    },
    {
      "start": 13.754,
      "end": 18.01,
      "zh": "不用手工建虚拟环境，*也不用记 activate*。",
      "en": "No manual venv, no remembering to activate it."
    },
    {
      "start": 18.11,
      "end": 23.158,
      "zh": "建项目、加依赖、跑脚本，*三步都在 uv 里*。",
      "en": "Create, add, run — all three stay inside uv."
    },
    {
      "start": 23.258,
      "end": 27.202,
      "zh": "版本由 uv 管，*换台机器也能复现*。",
      "en": "uv pins the version, so another machine reproduces it."
    },
    {
      "start": 27.302,
      "end": 30.742,
      "zh": "但换一台电脑，*旧办法就全乱了*。",
      "en": "But the old way falls apart on a different computer."
    },
    {
      "start": 30.842,
      "end": 34.834,
      "zh": "系统 Python 升一次级，*依赖就跟着漂*。",
      "en": "One system upgrade and your dependencies drift."
    },
    {
      "start": 34.934,
      "end": 38.662,
      "zh": "学生最常问的，还是*包装到哪儿去了*。",
      "en": "The top question: where did my package actually go?"
    },
    {
      "start": 38.762,
      "end": 42.154,
      "zh": "同一条命令，*三个平台都一样*。",
      "en": "One command works the same on all three platforms."
    },
    {
      "start": 42.254,
      "end": 46.174,
      "zh": "不用预装 Python，*也不用管理员权限*。",
      "en": "No preinstalled Python, no admin rights required."
    },
    {
      "start": 46.274,
      "end": 49.702,
      "zh": "先让代码跑起来，*再谈原理*。",
      "en": "Get the code running first. Then talk theory."
    }
  ]
}
